{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33201","headline":"和薛逢赠别 · 高璩","name":"和薛逢赠别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒外绵州第一州，尊前偏喜接君留。\n歌声婉转添长恨，管色凄凉似到秋。\n但务欢娱思晓角，独耽云水上高楼。\n莫言此去难相见，怨别徵黄是顺流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高璩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}